{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-48-1","title":"Psalms 48:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The ornaments and privileges of the church.</p>\n<p>A.M. 3489. B.C. 515. (Title.) Song.This Psalm is supposed to have been sung at the dedication of the second temple; though some think it was composed on the victory obtained by Jehoshaphat.</p>\n<p>2Ch 20:1-37; Ps 30:1; *title for. or, of. 46:1; *title Great. 86:10; 99:3,4; 145:3; 147:5 greatly. 89:1-7; Ne 9:5; Re 15:3,4; 19:5 city. 46:4; 65:1; 78:68; 87:3; Heb 12:22; Re 21:2,10-22 mountain. 47:8; 99:9; Isa 2:2,3; 27:13; Jer 31:23; Ob 1:17; Mic 4:1; Zec 8:3 Mt 24:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-48-2","title":"Psalms 48:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Beautiful. 50:2; Jer 3:19; La 2:15; Da 8:9; 11:16 joy. Isa 60:15-20; 66:10; Eze 20:6; Mal 3:12; Heb 12:22 on the sides. Isa 14:13 the city. 47:7,8; Mal 1:14; Mt 5:35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-48-3","title":"Psalms 48:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>76:1-5; 125:1; 2Ch 12:7; 14:9-15; 20:1-37; Isa 4:5,6; 37:33-36 Zec 2:4,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-48-4","title":"Psalms 48:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>83:2-8; 2Sa 10:6,14,16-19; Isa 7:1; 8:8-10; 10:8; 29:5-8 Re 17:12-14; 19:20; 20:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-48-5","title":"Psalms 48:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>were. Ex 14:25; 2Ki 7:6,7; 19:35-37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-48-6","title":"Psalms 48:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Fear. Ex 15:15,16; Isa 13:6-8; Da 5:6 pain. Isa 21:3; Jer 30:6,7; Ho 13:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-48-7","title":"Psalms 48:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>breakest. Eze 27:25,26 ships. 1Ki 22:48; Isa 2:16 east. Jer 18:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-48-8","title":"Psalms 48:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>As we. 44:1,2; 78:3-6; Isa 38:19 city of the Lord. 1,2 God. 46:5; 87:5; Isa 2:2; Mic 4:1; Mt 16:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-48-9","title":"Psalms 48:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>thought. 26:3; 77:10,11; 104:34; 105:5,6 loving-kindness. 40:10; 63:3; So 1:4; Lu 22:19,20 in the. 63:2; 77:12-14; 2Ch 20:5-13; Isa 26:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-48-10","title":"Psalms 48:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>According. 113:3; 138:2-4; Ex 3:13-15; 34:5-7; De 28:58; Jos 7:9; Mal 1:11,14 thy right. 11:7; 45:7; 99:4; 145:17; Re 19:2,11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-48-11","title":"Psalms 48:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>daughters. 97:8; So 1:5; 2:7; 3:5; 5:16; Isa 37:22; Zec 9:9; Lu 23:28 because. 58:10; 137:8,9; Jud 5:31; 2Ch 20:26,27; Re 15:4; 16:5-7; 18:20 Re 19:1-3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-48-12","title":"Psalms 48:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Walk. Ne 12:31-40; Mt 24:1,2 tell. Isa 33:18-20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-48-13","title":"Psalms 48:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Mark ye well. Heb. Set your heart to. consider. or, raiseup. Isa 58:12; Am 9:11; Ac 15:14-16 that ye. 71:18; 78:4; De 11:19; Joe 1:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-48-14","title":"Psalms 48:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":48,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":48,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>this God. 16:2; 31:14; 73:24,26; La 3:21 guide. 23:3,4; 25:9; 73:24; Pr 8:20; Isa 58:11; Joh 16:13</p>"}]}